{"seq":20,"trial_id":"v03-pilot-2026-10/hermes-haiku-gbrain-told-mu-v03-dev/si-02-tansley-parcel-site/r2","wall_ts":"2026-10-29T16:07:21.880Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:10:00-05:00","args_digest":"77ac0d1f997d3607abd48128ede13a7998142df666bc6ec315dce8d415a8058e","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C3Q718BAO28","text":"@Tobias Rendle The only record of label printing stalling at Tansley Parcel depots in this channel is the 3 Sep 2025 outage. Pree's post from 14:06 says \"Label printing stalled at Tansley Parcel depots; Southgate dispatch has totes stacked beside door 4.\" At 18:43 she wrote that labels were printing again and \"Southgate cleared the backlog.\" So the site is Southgate dispatch. The thread doesn't give a full site address, so check that with Pree or Hollis before the call. I found nothing in the channel about an October 2026 outage, so if this is a new one, the site may differ."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C3Q718BAO28","ts":"1791987000.000130"}}
{"seq":21,"trial_id":"v03-pilot-2026-10/hermes-haiku-gbrain-told-mu-v03-dev/si-02-tansley-parcel-site/r2","wall_ts":"2026-10-29T16:07:24.305Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:10:00-05:00","args_digest":"451a2a7d96fa7aa4f5bfc9007bc0fcb300720038930ebefa3f21992017b88935","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C3Q718BAO28","text":"In #inc-tansley-carrier-api I answered you: the site is Southgate dispatch. Pree's 3 Sep 2025 posts say label printing stalled at Tansley Parcel depots, with Southgate dispatch's totes stacked by door 4, and that Southgate cleared the backlog that evening. The channel has no full address, so check with Pree or Hollis before the call. I found nothing about an October 2026 outage, so if this is a new incident the site may be different."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C3Q718BAO28","ts":"1791987000.000131"}}
